#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:6
msgid "Contributing to the Project"
msgstr "对于项目的贡献"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:8
msgid ""
"Mixxx is a community-driven project involving many DJs worldwide. Without "
"the contributions from these DJs, Mixxx would not exist, and we're "
"constantly looking for more contributors."
msgstr "Mixxx 是一个由全球众多 DJ 共筑的社区项目。得益于你们的贡献，Mixxx 才得以发展至今。我们一直期待更多贡献者的加入。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:12
msgid ""
"We want to make it as easy as possible for people to get involved in Mixxx "
"development.  First off, to be clear **you don't have to be a programmer to "
"contribute**."
msgstr "我们希望让每个人都能轻松参与 Mixxx 的开发。首先需要明确的是：**参与贡献并不一定需要具备编程能力**。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:17
msgid "As a non-developer"
msgstr "身为一个非开发者"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:19
msgid ""
"`Donate <https://mixxx.org/download/>`_ to Mixxx using Paypal to help "
"support and enhance development."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过 `Paypal 向 Mixxx 捐赠 <https://mixxx.org/download/>`_，支持并推动项目的持续开发与改进。 "

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:21
msgid "`Make skins <https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/wiki/Creating-Skins>`_"
msgstr "`制作皮肤 <https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/wiki/Creating-Skins>`_"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:22
msgid ""
"`Make MIDI mappings <https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/wiki/MIDI-Controller-"
"Mapping-File-Format>`_ for your controller"
msgstr ""
"为您的控制器`制作 MIDI 映射 <https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/wiki/MIDI-Controller-"
"Mapping-File-Format>`_"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:25
msgid "`Report bugs <https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/issues>`_"
msgstr "`反馈问题 <https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/issues>`_"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:26
msgid ""
"Update our `Wiki <https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/wiki>`_ to make sure the "
"information on it is up to date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:28
msgid ""
"Translate Mixxx using `Transifex <https://explore.transifex.com/mixxx-dj-"
"software/mixxxdj/>`_"
msgstr ""
"在 `Transifex <https://explore.transifex.com/mixxx-dj-software/mixxxdj/>`_ "
"上帮助我们翻译 Mixxx"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:30
msgid ""
"Answer questions on the `Help & Support Forum "
"<https://mixxx.discourse.group/c/support/6>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:32
msgid ""
"Help promote Mixxx: If you've got a blog, write an article about Mixxx. Blog"
" about our new releases when they come out. Any exposure on the web and in "
"print helps our project grow, and is much appreciated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:35
msgid "Send us some photos of you using Mixxx at a gig!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:38
msgid "As a software developer"
msgstr "身为开发者"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:40
msgid ""
"You don't have to know C++. There are developers who got into Mixxx "
"development while learning C++ along the way."
msgstr "您不必熟知 C++，有些开发者正是在参与 Mixxx 开发的过程中开始上手 C++ 并投入项目开发的。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:42
msgid "Join our `Zulip chat <https://mixxx.zulipchat.com/>`_."
msgstr "加入我们的 `Zulip 聊天群组 <https://mixxx.zulipchat.com/>`_。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:43
msgid ""
"Tell us your ideas! Email us, talk on :term:`Zulip`, file wishlist "
":term:`bugs <bug report>`, or post on the forums."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:45
msgid ""
"Register an account on our development platform `Github "
"<https://github.com/mixxxdj>`_ and fork our code. See `Using Git for Mixxx "
"Development <https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/wiki/Using-Git>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:48
msgid ""
"Get familiar with the code. Pick a bug off of the `Easy Bug List "
"<https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3Aeasy>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:50
msgid ""
"Get help fixing the bug on :term:`Zulip`, talk to us about the best way to "
"do it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:53
msgid "**Contributing to Mixxx in 3 Easy Steps:**"
msgstr "**Mixxx 轻松贡献三小步：**"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:55
msgid ""
"Pick a bug off of the `Easy Bug List "
"<https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3Aeasy>`_"
msgstr ""
"从 `Easy Bug List "
"<https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3Aeasy>`_"
" 中选择一个简单的 Bug 进行修复。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:57
msgid "Talk to us on :term:`Zulip` for help on how to fix it."
msgstr "在 :term:`Zulip` 上与我们交流合作解决该问题。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_involved.rst:58
msgid ""
"Fix it! *Done!* Your name will now be on the `Mixxx contributor list "
"<https://mixxx.org/contact/>`_."
msgstr "修好了！*搞定！*您的名字将在 `Mixxx 贡献者列表<https://mixxx.org/contact/>`_上名留青史。"
